                                                "sense_id": "ea3ca0f5-d2e0-39d9-8fda-f3fbd1e87419",
                                                "text": "Both [Ze'ev] Jabotinsky and [David] Ben-Gurion also wrote songs of praise to the Ottoman Empire, its tolerance toward ethnic minorities in general — and to Jews in particular — as well as to the democratic changes it was undergoing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
